step Riding at 40
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the Grom'gol zeppelin.
  train 4773 optional                   -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer
  note "Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."

